      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>| 󰀌 | 1 ＋ | R_(4) | 󰀍 | |---|---|---|---| | 󰀘 | 1 ＋ | R_(3) | 󰀙 | | 󰀌 | R_(2) | 󰀍 | |---|---|---| | 󰀘 | R_(1) ＋ R_(2) | 󰀙 |</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
