          <choice_text>$1200 \sqrt{3}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>1200√3 ≈ 2,078W는 Δ부하 전력 3,000W에도 미치지 않는 값이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$1200 \sqrt{5}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>1200√5 ≈ 2,683W는 피상전력과 유효전력을 혼동한 값으로 옳지 않다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$3600$</choice_text>
          <commentary>3,600W는 두 부하 전력의 합 6,000W와 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$6000$</choice_text>
          <commentary>Δ부하 3 × (30,000/180) × 6 = 3,000W와 Y부하 3 × (10,000/20) × 2 = 3,000W의 합은 6,000W이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
